<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan's Hub Power gains 2.65 pct.</title>
<headline>Pakistan's Hub Power gains 2.65 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's Hub Power Co shares gained 1.25 rupees, or 2.65 percent, to 46.55 on Monday to hit a new year-high on fresh buying at the start of new fiscal year (1997/98 July-June), dealers said.</p>
<p>Dealers said there had been aggressive foreign buying of the stock at the start of new fiscal year on expectations of substantial corporate profits.</p>
<p>&quot;Hub Power has gained sharply during the recent rally mainly on foreign buying,&quot; dealer Ather Raouf said. &quot;Local investors have followed suit.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
